---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import questions from '../data/questions.json';
---
<Layout>
  <section class="personal-home">
    <h1>I invest in software.<br/>I’ve built it, too.</h1>
    <div class="home-bio">
      <p>I’m Sean. I’ve spent the last decade and a half building and investing in software companies, from inception through growth. Today, I’m a partner at <a href="https://www.meritholdings.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Merit Holdings</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="work" class="home-section narrative">
    <h2>Work & background</h2>
    <ul class="skim-list work-list">
      <li><a href="https://www.meritholdings.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Merit Holdings</a> <span>— Partner. Long-term ownership of vertical software businesses.</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.racepace.cc/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Racepace</a> <span>— Previously founded. AI cycling coaching.</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://pathlight.vc/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Pathlight Ventures</a> <span>— Inception and pre-seed through early Series A.</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://openviewpartners.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OpenView</a> <span>— Growth investing. Series A, Series B, and beyond.</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://dispatch.me/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Dispatch</a> <span>— Company building in field services software.</span></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="background-note">Across product, go-to-market, fundraising, and corporate development. B2B and consumer; mostly vertical software.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="questions" class="home-section narrative">
    <h2>Questions I keep coming back to</h2>
    <ul class="skim-list question-list">
      {questions.map(({ topic, question }) => <li><strong>{topic}.</strong> {question}</li>)}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="writing" class="home-section">
    <h2>Writing</h2>
    <a class="entry" href="https://seanfanning.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span>Capital Markets Roundup</span><span>Substack <i>↗</i></span></a>
    <p class="aside">My archive of writing on markets and companies.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section narrative personal-section">
    <h2>Outside work</h2>
    <ul class="skim-list">
      <li>Cycling, training, and racing. Leadville 100 finisher.</li>
      <li>Former president and captain, Boston College men’s rowing.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
